//RS     /// `@new.Type.Variant@{ field: expr }` (enum value) and
//RS     /// `@s.Type@{ field: expr }` (struct value). Literal fields use checked Jet
//RS     /// names; a unit variant takes no braces and `{ .. }` ignores a payload.
//RS     /// A pattern or enum value may instead list its payload positionally,
